      "message": "Better to change to more cpp friendly format ? Following is just an example.\n\n```\nlong int Software::getRandomId()\n{\n    // The static generator is initialized exactly once (thread-safe in C++11)\n    static std::mt19937 generator([]() {\n        // 1. Get current time in nanoseconds\n        auto now \u003d std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\n        auto nanos \u003d std::chrono::duration_cast\u003cstd::chrono::nanoseconds\u003e(\n                         now.time_since_epoch()).count();\n        \n        // 2. Mix with Process ID and a hardware entropy seed\n        return static_cast\u003cunsigned int\u003e(nanos) ^ getpid() ^ std::random_device{}();\n    }());\n\n    std::uniform_int_distribution\u003clong int\u003e distribution(0, 9999);\n    return distribution(generator);\n}\n\n```",
